<title>HUNGARY: Zalakeramia H1 '97 IAS net profit 427.4mln.</title>
<headline>Zalakeramia H1 '97 IAS net profit 427.4mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-June 1997     Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Profit of basic activities   231.7	  vs   294.2</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		498.4	  vs   356.3</p>
<p>    Net profit			 427.4	  vs   273.3</p>
<p>    Sales			    3,460.0	  vs 1,683.0</p>
<p>    Direct prime cost of sales 1,981.5	  vs 1,095.0</p>
<p>    Gross margin		   1,478.5	  vs   588.0</p>
<p>    General costs		  1,246.9	  vs   293.8</p>
<p>    Revenue from other</p>
<p>     transactions		    336.9	  vs    56.5</p>
<p>    Revenue from financial</p>
<p>     transactions		     31.9 loss   vs    9.4 profit</p>
<p>    Non-operational items	   38.3 loss   vs    3.8 loss</p>
<p>    Tax liability		     17.4	  vs    83.0 (*)</p>
<p>    Investments, minorities	 53.5	  vs     0.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Zalakeramia Rt is a tile manufacturer. The figures were calculated in accordance with International Accounting Standards, are consolidated and unaudited.</p>
<p>(*) Tax liabilities are calculated according to Hungarian laws which record capital increase costs against profits, in contrast with IAS rules. Thus the amount of corporate tax decreased by a coinsiderable extent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
